w("## 7. Limitations of this phase")
w()
w("- Section 1 uses the released feature columns (170 / 170 / 159), not the SI's 190 / 190 / 179, and the SI Table S5 variants use released batch size and patience; the thermal gap to the SI could come from these unknowns, from different data versions, or from something not documented. I did not investigate further.")
w("- Section 1d compares a leaky and a clean half of one test set; the halves differ in composition. The group definition is the refcode-family + DOI proxy.")
w("- Section 3 uses random forests (not the released networks) and one clustering recipe; the shortfall may differ for other models, cluster counts or embeddings, and a real deployment shift (new data source, later years) may be larger or smaller than k-means cluster shift.")
w("- Section 5's NN ranges rest on 10 splits; the RF ranges on 100, with a different model class from the released networks.")
